<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cesp Q1 loss shrinks vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cesp Q1 loss shrinks vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state owned power firm Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo (Cesp) sent to the Sao Paulo bolsa the following preliminary first-quarter 1997 results.</p>
<p>			 Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p> Loss		  68.023 million	  120.91 million</p>
<p> Share Loss	   0.12		  N/A</p>
<p> Gross Profit     187.53 million	   154.0 million</p>
<p> Net Oper Revs    883.52 million	   820.93 million</p>
<p> Net Worth	   12.821 bln	   12.706 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
